{"id":"ch-e569561ec600","html":"<div class=\"prose\">         <span class=\"source-page\" style=\"background-color:#000000;color:inherit\"> <span class=\"source-ink\" style=\"color:#ffffff\">    <span class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"dropcap\"><span class=\"strong\">猫</span></span>：哎。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：该叹气的是我，不是你。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：每只猫都有自己的苦恼；偏偏我是最苦的那只。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：你还好意思这么认为吗？是你的不负责任，导致天庭乱成这样。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：看来你对我意见不浅啊。不过，我有惊喜。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（猫掏出了奖章，轻轻把猫爪搭在狄利克雷大腿上。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：（平淡地）你找回来啦？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：是啊——你不应该为此感到高兴吗？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：我已经没有精力高兴了。这是你的本分。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：哎……<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（猫用爪子摩挲着奖章<span class=\"note\" role=\"note\">   ♪<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"music\"><span>♫ quartet2</span><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"assets/asset-15efc746bae5.mp3\" aria-label=\"播放 quartet2\"></audio></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </span>  ♪。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"illustration svg-illustration\" data-source-pdf=\"quartet2.pdf\"><img src=\"assets/pdf-svg/asset-b484e97da99a-1.svg\" width=\"978\" height=\"411\" alt=\"quartet2，第 1 页\" loading=\"lazy\"><a href=\"assets/asset-b484e97da99a.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">原 PDF · quartet2 ↗</a></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：这段旋律是什么？就是你说的门德尔松的同一首曲子的后半部吗？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：本喵很高兴引起了你的兴趣——是的，这段是门德尔松Op.81第三乐章后半部的<a class=\"entity-link\" id=\"ref-2b6c559a1402\" href=\"#index/idx-48ce0b86e0ee\" data-index=\"idx-48ce0b86e0ee\" aria-label=\"查看索引：赋格（fugue）\">赋格</a><a class=\"index-ref\" id=\"ref-17e2fab1286e\" href=\"#index/idx-7dcf3119a6a2\" data-index=\"idx-7dcf3119a6a2\" aria-label=\"查看索引：赋格（fugue） › 门德尔松 Op.81 第三乐章后半段\"><sup>索引</sup></a>，速度标记是<span class=\"emphasis\">Allegro fugato, assai vivace</span>。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：怪不得那么轻快了。赋格，赋格——有点似曾相识；的确，听起来像是几段移调过的旋律先后出场，交织在一起呢。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：是的——我就说你肯定是听说过赋格这个概念的。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……这一切都发生在同一个舞台——主角就是你们所看到的<span class=\"inline-math\" data-formula=\"formula-491c56c067b6\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"inline-math\" data-formula=\"formula-9a63fce3ac81\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{g(\\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord katex-overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.87em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>…… <span class=\"display-math\" data-formula=\"formula-340c6f850446\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mi mat